@baseUrl = http://localhost:5231

### Create registration
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "participantName": "Ana Reyes",
  "contactNumber": "09171234567",
  "email": "ana.reyes@example.com",
  "address": "Sorsogon City",
  "carMakeModel": "Nissan GT-R",
  "plateNumber": "CSV-2027-003",
  "registrationType": "Competitor",
  "amountPaid": 2500
}

### Get registrations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/registrations

### Get registrations by type and status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/registrations?registrationType=1&registrationStatus=0

### Get registration summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/registrations/summary
